    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="grid" style="margin: 0;">
                <tr id="comment-header-444195"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3"
                id="word_commented_6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3">
                    王维甲
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">17/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-444195"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>1.观察到18环境在3个控制节点  wget <a href="http://bj_pkg.easystack.io:8000/build_cloud_product_file/aarch64/6.2.1_registry-cloud-product.tar" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://bj_pkg.easystack.io:8000/build_cloud_product_file/aarch64/6.2.1_registry-cloud-product.tar</a><br/>
wget <a href="http://fs.easystack.cn/ovn/ovn-6.1.3-ipv6_x86_64.tar" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">http://fs.easystack.cn/ovn/ovn-6.1.3-ipv6_x86_64.tar</a><br/>
都很慢，感觉像是限速了，但是查看对应的fip和虚拟网卡都没有限速，迁移这个shared_router到其他节点还是没有效果</p>

<p>2.把fip 172.18.0.164上的限速全部去掉，trace流表的时候发现还是有meter：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre># 在33环境执行wget http://bj_pkg.easystack.io:8000/build_cloud_product_file/aarch64/6.2.1_registry-cloud-product.tar
[root@node-7 ~]# flow=$(tcpdump -i enp4s0f1 -nne  dst 172.33.0.3 -c1 -xx | ovs-tcpundump)
[root@node-7 ~]# ovs-appctl ofproto/trace br-int in_port=`ovs-vsctl get Interface patch-br-int-to-provnet-c80ff37c-52b1-4191-9a1e-4230e0da8ab8 ofport` $flow</pre>
</div></div>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/345581" alt="企业微信截图_17419559861089-20250314-123946.png" height="77" width="1324" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-444197"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3"
                id="word_commented_6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6018eef44e258e00694e3eb3">
                    王维甲
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">17/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-444197"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>ovn-nbctl --no-leader-only set NB_Global . options:unknown_supression_rate=0 去掉就恢复了</p>
        </td></tr>
                <tr id="comment-header-444216"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5fc5e7aa4a0964006962db06"
                id="word_commented_5fc5e7aa4a0964006962db06"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fc5e7aa4a0964006962db06">
                    丁智慧
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">17/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-444216"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>在ovs中trace了一下流量发现，get_fdb并没有找到外部主机的地址，导致走进reg15=8001的未知泛洪流程：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>27. metadata=0x61, priority 0, cookie 0x709431b9
    resubmit(,28)
28. metadata=0x61, priority 0, cookie 0xb5726e11
    resubmit(,29)
29. metadata=0x61, priority 0, cookie 0x3b1691a2
    resubmit(,30)
30. metadata=0x61, priority 0, cookie 0xbb3bc92b
    set_field:0-&gt;reg15
    resubmit(,71)
    71. No match.
            drop
    resubmit(,31)
31. reg15=0,metadata=0x61, priority 52, cookie 0x3fb93575
    meter:278
    set_field:0x8001-&gt;reg15
    resubmit(,37)
37. priority 0
    resubmit(,38)
38. reg15=0x8001,metadata=0x61, priority 100, cookie 0x22ee94fb
    set_field:0x1-&gt;reg15
    resubmit(,39)
    39. priority 0
            set_field:0-&gt;reg0
            set_field:0-&gt;reg1
            set_field:0-&gt;reg2
            set_field:0-&gt;reg3
            set_field:0-&gt;reg4
            set_field:0-&gt;reg5
            set_field:0-&gt;reg6
            set_field:0-&gt;reg7
            set_field:0-&gt;reg8
            set_field:0-&gt;reg9
            resubmit(,40)
        40. ip,reg15=0x1,metadata=0x61, priority 110, cookie 0xc8a4eb84
            resubmit(,41)
        41. metadata=0x61, priority 0, cookie 0x6330ed0f
            resubmit(,42)
        42. metadata=0x61, priority 0, cookie 0x7ff021e
            resubmit(,43)</pre>
</div></div>

<p>看了fdb表确实没有学习这个mac，并且ovs的table=71也没有：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>()[root@ovn-tool-0 /]#
()[root@ovn-tool-0 /]# ovn-sbctl list fdb | grep 26:8a:4b:46:5e:f2
()[root@ovn-tool-0 /]#</pre>
</div></div>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>[root@node-22 ~]# ovs-ofctl dump-flows br-int table=71
 cookie=0x7882d92, duration=1502.156s, table=71, n_packets=0, n_bytes=0, priority=100,metadata=0x17,dl_dst=fa:16:3e:b6:3c:a5 actions=load:0x1f-&gt;NXM_NX_REG15[]
