                <tr id="comment-header-444221"><td bgcolor="#f0f0f0">
            评论于 
                                                    
                
        
            <a class="user-hover" rel="5fc5e7aa4a0964006962db06"
                id="word_commented_5fc5e7aa4a0964006962db06"
                href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fc5e7aa4a0964006962db06">
                    丁智慧
                </a>

                                        <font size="-2">
            [
                <font color="#336699">17/三月/25</font>

                            ]
            </font>

        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-444221"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p>put-fdb逻辑流表不会在localnet端口上起作用，也就是localnet端口不会学习fdb，这样就会导致所有外部的流量都走了未知转发的限速：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>()[root@ovn-tool-0 /]# ovn-nbctl show eec87400-4a78-486a-ba7b-d7bdd09ad73b
switch eec87400-4a78-486a-ba7b-d7bdd09ad73b (neutron-bcecf6cc-c6b9-4ccb-bfdc-a9c0a3f93f6e) (aka daniel-v602)
    port 40d9cdfc-3905-4195-9038-5699cd6e5179
        type: router
        router-port: lrp-40d9cdfc-3905-4195-9038-5699cd6e5179
    port provnet-776aab32-0436-4574-a2e7-de9029b73da8
        type: localnet
        tag: 602
        addresses: ["unknown"]
    port 25578401-80a6-4a74-bd61-14bf3cccf001
        type: localport
        addresses: ["fa:16:3e:d2:bb:97"]
()[root@ovn-tool-0 /]#</pre>
</div></div>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>static void
build_lswitch_learn_fdb_op(
        struct ovn_port *op, struct hmap *lflows,
        struct ds *actions, struct ds *match)
{
    if (op-&gt;nbsp &amp;&amp; !op-&gt;n_ps_addrs &amp;&amp; !strcmp(op-&gt;nbsp-&gt;type, "") &amp;&amp;
        op-&gt;has_unknown) {
        ds_clear(match);
        ds_clear(actions);
        ds_put_format(match, "inport == %s", op-&gt;json_key);
        ds_put_format(actions, REGBIT_LKUP_FDB
                      " = lookup_fdb(inport, eth.src); next;");
        ovn_lflow_add_with_lport_and_hint(lflows, op-&gt;od,
                                          S_SWITCH_IN_LOOKUP_FDB, 100,
                                          ds_cstr(match), ds_cstr(actions),
                                          op-&gt;key, &amp;op-&gt;nbsp-&gt;header_);

        ds_put_cstr(match, " &amp;&amp; "REGBIT_LKUP_FDB" == 0");
        ds_clear(actions);
        ds_put_cstr(actions, "put_fdb(inport, eth.src); next;");
        ovn_lflow_add_with_lport_and_hint(lflows, op-&gt;od, S_SWITCH_IN_PUT_FDB,
                                          100, ds_cstr(match),
                                          ds_cstr(actions), op-&gt;key,
                                          &amp;op-&gt;nbsp-&gt;header_);
    }
}</pre>
</div></div>
        </td></tr>
            </table>
